      {
        "id": 114601,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-14T17:06:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Melee is correct.</p><p>Origin is correct.</p><p>Aoe is correct.</p><p>Range is calculated from the object that is creating the hazard space, and elevation counts. &nbsp;Turret bot needs line of sight, and if he's firing up 2 levels and out 2 hexes that's a range of 4. &nbsp;If Impaling Structure triggers you are standing on it, and the range is 0, because the structure creates the hazard.</p><p>Vertex, yes it works the same.</p><p>Yes, that is how reach works.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:33.402Z",
