        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Melee is correct.</p><p>Origin is correct.</p><p>Aoe is correct.</p><p>Range is calculated from the object that is creating the hazard space, and elevation counts. &nbsp;Turret bot needs line of sight, and if he&#39;s firing up 2 levels and out 2 hexes that&#39;s a range of 4. &nbsp;If Impaling Structure triggers you are standing on it, and the range is 0, because the structure creates the hazard.</p><p>Vertex, yes it works the same.</p><p>Yes, that is how reach works.</p>",
